 <p>Waypoint checks, interval unions, robot recovery and authenticated messaging are established techniques. The defensible research claim is their implemented edge-level contract and its measured behavior against the specified coverage-aware baseline. The study does not establish worldwide priority for every constituent technique or superiority over all coverage planners.</p>
 <h3 id="literature-comparison-and-originality-boundary">Literature comparison and originality boundary</h3>
-<p>A targeted literature review on <strong>26 October 2026</strong> found substantial overlap with earlier work. The implemented method and completed experiments establish a research artifact; <strong>scientific originality still needs a precise comparison</strong>. The following sources constrain the claim.</p>
