-<p>This is a targeted comparison, not an exhaustive priority search. B2 remains a fair controlled baseline, but the study has <strong>not compared VECR against fixed-rewind or other local resume methods</strong>. The mathematical inclusion argument is useful and conditional; it does not establish a new general theorem. A completed simulator protocol and a dissertation-ready novelty argument are different milestones. The <a href="assets/evidence/NOVELTY_AND_DEFENSE_ASSESSMENT_2026-10-26.md">full assessment</a> records the reasoning and recommended follow-up.</p>
+<p>Local repair of processing faults also predates this work: <a href="https://doi.org/10.1007/978-3-319-22876-1_31">Nykolaychuk and Ortmeier, 2015</a> [R9]. Correct monitoring of streams arriving with different delays is established by <a href="https://link.springer.com/article/10.1007/s11219-019-09493-y">Leucker et al., 2020</a> [R10]. Neither local repair nor delayed-event handling is claimed as a first invention.</p>
