-<p>ArduPilot SITL runs autopilot software against simulated dynamics [R3], adding autopilot mode/command/telemetry behavior beyond SimBackend. The stage needs independent truth, declared observation bounds and qualified recovery feasibility; live MAVLink recovery currently remains disabled.</p>
